<title>GERMANY: PAN-GERMAN DEC INDUSTRY OUTPUT RISES 1.4 PCT M/M.</title>
<headline>PAN-GERMAN DEC INDUSTRY OUTPUT RISES 1.4 PCT M/M.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The economics ministry reported the</p>
<p>following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT  Dec 96     Nov 96	 Dec 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)   +1.4	 +0.9(+1.6)  -1.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year		     +3.3	 +0.7(+1.3)  -4.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)	     100.2	 98.8(99.5)  97.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted and provisional. The</p>
<p>year-on-year figures are calculated by Reuters from Bundesbank</p>
<p>statistics.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following details:</p>
<p>				    Dec 96		   Nov 96</p>
<p>				Index   Pct change  Index   Pct change</p>
<p> Mining			78.3	+4.1	75.2	+0.3</p>
<p> Manufacturing output    98.0	+0.6	97.4	+1.4</p>
<p> Incl:Intermed. goods   104.1	+3.2     100.9	+0.2</p>
<p>	Capital goods	94.3	-3.0	97.2	+2.9</p>
<p>	Consumer durables  84.0	-1.2	85.0	+2.2</p>
<p>	Consumer goods     98.1	+2.4	95.8	+0.9</p>
<p> Energy output	    105.4	+1.9     103.4	-1.4</p>
<p> Construction	     122.7	+6.9     114.8	-1.5 </p>
<p>Two month comparison Nov/Dec 96 with Sept/Oct 96:</p>
<p> Industrial output		     +1.5</p>
<p> Manufacturing output		  +1.0</p>
<p> Construction			    +2.5</p>
<p> Capital goods			   unch</p>
<p> Mining				    +3.0</p>
<p> Energy output			   +0.5</p>
<p> Consumer durables and goods	 +1.5</p>
<p> Intermediate goods		    +2.0</p>
<p>Two month comparison Nov/Dec 1996 with Nov/Dec 1995:</p>
<p> Industrial output		     +1.4</p>
<p> Mining				    -2.0  </p>
<p> Manufacturing output:		 +2.0</p>
<p> Incl: Intermediate goods	    +4.2</p>
<p> Capital goods			   +0.4</p>
<p> Consumer durables		     +2.1</p>
<p> Consumer goods			  +0.9</p>
<p> Energy output			   -0.9</p>
<p> Construction			    -1.3</p>
<p> W.GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT    Dec 96     Nov 96	 Dec 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)   +1.1	 +1.1(+2.0)   -0.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year		     +2.4	 +1.1(+2.1)    n/a</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		96.8	 95.7(96.5)   94.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted and provisional. The</p>
<p>year-on-year figures are calculated by Reuters from Bundesbank</p>
<p> E.GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT    Dec 96     Nov 96	 Dec 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)  +4.5	 unch(-0.3)   -6.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year		    +11.8	 +0.5(+0.1)    n/a</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)	     147.0	140.7(140.2) 131.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted and provisional. The</p>
<p>year-on-year figures are calculated by Reuters from Bundesbnk</p>
<p>statistics. Previously reported data in brackets. </p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn Newsroom, 49-28-26097150</p>
</text>
